Role Summary &nbsp;

We are seeking a highly experienced AI Product Owner to drive the vision, strategy, and delivery of AI-powered customer solutions. The ideal candidate will be a self-starter capable of operating independently, managing senior stakeholders, and translating business priorities into actionable product roadmaps. &nbsp;

This role requires a hands-on Product Owner who can rapidly understand complex customer needs, define AI-driven products and features, and lead cross-functional teams to deliver measurable business outcomes. &nbsp;

Key Responsibilities &nbsp;

• Define and own the AI product vision, roadmap, and backlog. &nbsp;

• Collaborate with business stakeholders, engineering teams, data scientists, and UX teams to deliver AI-enabled customer solutions. &nbsp;

• Identify high-value AI opportunities and translate them into prioritized product requirements. &nbsp;

• Create user stories, acceptance criteria, and business requirements for development teams. &nbsp;

• Drive product discovery, experimentation, and validation using data-driven approaches. &nbsp;

• Lead sprint planning, backlog refinement, prioritization, and release planning activities. &nbsp;

• Measure product success through KPIs, customer outcomes, and business value realization. &nbsp;

• Manage stakeholder expectations and communicate progress effectively across business and technology teams. &nbsp;

• Ensure delivery aligns with strategic objectives and customer experience goals. &nbsp;

Required Skills &nbsp;

• 8+ years of Product Management/Product Ownership experience. &nbsp;

• Experience delivering AI, Generative AI, Machine Learning, or Intelligent Automation solutions. &nbsp;

• Strong understanding of Agile/Scrum methodologies. &nbsp;

• Experience writing detailed user stories and managing product backlogs. &nbsp;

• Ability to work independently with minimal supervision. &nbsp;

• Strong stakeholder management and communication skills. &nbsp;

• Experience working with cross-functional engineering and data teams. &nbsp;

• Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills. &nbsp;

Preferred Skills &nbsp;

• Experience in Banking, Financial Services, or Retail Banking domains. &nbsp;

• Knowledge of GenAI, LLMs, Conversational AI, RAG architectures, or AI Agents. &nbsp;

• Experience with Azure OpenAI, AWS AI, Google Vertex AI, or equivalent AI platforms. &nbsp;

• Certifications in Product Management, Agile, Scrum, or AI-related disciplines. &nbsp;

